    <h2>1. The service</h2>
    <p>League office lets league owners and club operators sign in, manage leagues, teams, lineups, and schedules, and receive account-related notices. By creating an account or using the service, you agree to these Terms of Service and the <a class="link" href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>2. Accounts and sign-in</h2>
    <p>You may sign in with a one-time link sent to your email address, or to a mobile phone number you have saved on your owner record after opting in to texts. You must use contact details you control. You are responsible for activity on your account.</p>
    <h2>3. SMS / text messaging program (League office alerts)</h2>
    <p><strong>Program name:</strong> League office alerts<br /><strong>Brand:</strong> League office / bAIseball</p>
    <p>By providing your mobile phone number and affirmatively opting in on the Account page or the sign-in text form, you consent to receive <strong>transactional</strong> text messages from League office. These messages may include one-time sign-in / authentication links and account alerts related to your league office access.</p>
    <p>League office does <strong>not</strong> send marketing, promotional, or advertising texts under this program.</p>
    <p><strong>Message frequency:</strong> Message frequency varies. You may receive up to 8 messages per month, depending on how often you request a sign-in text or receive account alerts. Consent is not a condition of using League office; you may use email sign-in instead.</p>
    <p><strong>Message and data rates may apply.</strong> Carrier fees are your responsibility.</p>
    <p><strong>Opt out:</strong> Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any League office text to cancel. You will receive one confirmation that you have been unsubscribed, and you will not receive further texts unless you opt in again. You may also remove your phone number on the Account page.</p>
    <p><strong>Help:</strong> Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or email <a class="link" href="mailto:jeremyjbowers@gmail.com">jeremyjbowers@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Use the office only for leagues and teams you are entitled to administer. Do not attempt to access another owner’s account, harvest phone numbers, abuse the messaging program, or disrupt the service.</p>
